title: Root Scene
new-page: true
go-to: post_event if started = 1; start_menu if started = 0

@start_menu
new-page: true
go-to: start_menu_2

= PPS: An Alternate History

You play as the **PPS (Polska Partia Socjalistyczna)** in the first chapter of the Second Republic, from January 1922. The chapter ends when an attempted coup is resolved or with the next lawful Sejm election — on 19 February 1928 in the game's default legal calendar, not the historical election date — followed by a chapter report. Numbers are the game's working balance, not historical statistics.

@start_menu_2

- @start: Start game
- @election_simulation: Election simulation
- @credits: Credits
- @game_over.achievements


@start
call: polish_opening_state
