= January 1922

The campaign begins in January 1922.

Naczelnik Państwa: **Józef Piłsudski**. Prime minister: **Antoni Ponikowski**. Legislature: **Sejm Ustawodawczy**.

PPS tolerates the cabinet from outside, without ministries. Each month PPS takes one main action from its cards and agendas; the advisers can act in between. The first Sejm election is in November 1922.
